action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P91 on iPad: Tab moves the focus from one .focusable() view to the next.
#
#   zsh testapp/test_ios.zsh P91 --device "iPad Pro 11-inch (M5)" \
#       --actionfile testapp/actions/ios/P91-focusable-ipad.actions
#
# Everything is pressed by label, so no point here depends on the layout.
# Expected at the end: "A heard: a", "B heard: d", "focused: b".
# iPad 上的 P91:Tab 把焦點從一個 .focusable() view 移到下一個。全部以標籤按下，沒有任何點依賴版面。
# 結束時應為:A heard: a、B heard: d、focused: b。
sleep,,,,,,2500000,let P91 lay out,ios
taplabel,,,,,focus A,,from code,ios
sleep,,,,,,700000,,ios
key,,,,,a,,A heard: a,ios
sleep,,,,,,400000,,ios
key,,,,,tab,,Tab from A must reach B,ios
sleep,,,,,,800000,,ios
key,,,,,d,,B heard: d,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
